ndards  would you say to the government now that  it's money would be well spent with  Oxfam I would hope that the government  government would shortly have confidence  that they could give us money again we  are pleased that USAID the Americans are  giving I've restored funding as have the  Swedes the Swedish Development Agency we  we've obviously got a big issue in  Britain about restoring trust because we  are a British institution so I  completely understand that for the  government the decision made may take  some time but I would hope that this is  as I say the first step on the way to  getting back to there our normal  relations with the British government  and British government funding
 

